Dummy output: computes the stream, without actually using it.

Arguments:
- `id` : `string?` (default `null`) — Force the value of the source ID.
- `fallible` : `bool` (default `false`) — Allow the child source to fail, in which case the output will be stopped until the source is available again.
- `on_start` : `(() -> unit)?` (default `null`) — This argument is deprecated! Please use the `on_start` source method.
- `on_stop` : `(() -> unit)?` (default `null`) — This argument is deprecated! Please use the `on_stop` source method.
- `register_telnet` : `bool` (default `true`) — Register telnet commands for this output.
- `start` : `bool` (default `true`) — Start output as soon as it is available.
- `(unlabeled)` : `source('a)`
